# FrameShift thermal service, Valve layer (emergency-shutdown-design.md §6.2;
# EXEC-SPEC.md §9): reached only when fs-thermald publishes READY (core READY,
# fan class included, and the executor's preconditions), through
# fs-thermald-ready.service. Load-producing units Require= and After= it.
[Unit]
Description=FrameShift thermal supervisor READY
Requires=fs-thermald-ready.service
After=fs-thermald-ready.service
